        "text": "aden ereshe arars Prre NATIONAL PAYMENTS CORPORATION OF INDIA NPCI/UPI/OC No.204/2024-25 Date: 16\" Aug 2024 To, All Member of Unified Payment Interface (UPI) Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Enablement of Interoperable Cash Deposit using UPI at Cash Deposit/Recycler Machines. Ref: NPCI/2024-25/NFS/421 dated 16 August 2024 We are pleased to introduce functionality to facilitate Interoperable Cardless Cash Deposits using UPI. The facility can be provided at Cash deposit / Cash re-cycler machines (CDMs) deployed by the banks and White Label ATM Operators (WLAQs). This service shall facilitate (participating) bank’s customers who are live on UPI, to deposit cash in any participating banks’ / WLAQs’ CDMs (enabled for UPI-ICD) without using their card. Key Features:",
